      "description": "The validation report schema in FR-050.6 enumerates the allowed Dimension field values as <schema|structure|traceability|cross-file|parseability> (5 values), but FR-050.5 defines 7 validation dimensions. The report schema omits the \"interleave\" and \"decomposition\" dimensions (the two WARNING-severity dimensions). A finding raised under interleave or decomposition has no valid Dimension enum value to cite, making those two dimensions unrepresentable in the structured output.",
